    "lessonRef": null,
    "lesson": "<p>A <strong>fact family</strong> is a team of facts that use the same three numbers.</p>\n<p>3, 8, and 24 make a family: 3 × 8 = 24, &nbsp;8 × 3 = 24, &nbsp;24 ÷ 8 = 3, &nbsp;24 ÷ 3 = 8.</p>\n<p>Know one fact and you get three more for FREE!</p>",
